    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "元高ヨリ六十六石一斗四升七合八　崇神天皇御陵修覆云々ニ付之ヲ引ク"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "元高より六十六石一斗四升七合八（勺）　崇神天皇御陵修覆云々につき、これを引く"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Warichu (double-column) note: 66 koku 1 to 4 sho 7 gō 8 [shaku] — about 66.1478 koku — is deducted from the original assessment on account of the repair and upkeep of Emperor Sujin's imperial tomb and related expenses. The tomb stands at Yanagimoto in Yamato. The final sub-unit glyph (勺) is not printed; the reading runs across the two half-columns, so 崇 ends the right column and 神天皇 opens the left."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "御陵修覆引高注記"
      }
